      "id": "re-227",
      "subject": "Real Estate",
      "stem": "You are searching title for a purchaser and must determine how far back the abutting-land search for contraventions of ss. 50(3) and (5) of the Planning Act has to go. Nothing on title shortens the period. What is the default starting date?",
